/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.784 0.765 0.725 rg
62.3622047244094517 130.3939370078738875 Td
(The cost of inaction is steep: continued forecast misses that erode market confidence, high sales) Tj
T* (team attrition costing upwards of $100,000 per lost representative, and a fundamental inability to) Tj
T* (scale revenue without linearly scaling cost. This document is not a theoretical exercise. It is a) Tj
T* (blueprint for execution. It details the problem, provides the strategic framework, outlines a) Tj
T* (month-by-month implementation roadmap with clear KPIs and cost estimates, and projects a) Tj
T* (clear return on investment. The transition from intuition to intelligence is the single most critical) Tj
T* (strategic imperative for your go-to-market function. This playbook is your guide.) Tj
